DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260620T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260620T210000
SUMMARY:Evening Discussion and Dinner!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nEnjoy dinner and discussion at 
 Indian Curry Lounge with us\, 6:00pm\, Saturday June 20th!\n\nYou may reme
 mber this Indian restaurant location was previously known as Namaste\, and
  before that Tulsi. It is built into the first floor of the motel building
 \, it is two doors down from El Serranos\, where we meet for our other mon
 thly evening meeting!\n\nIndian Curry Lounge\n2101 Columbia Avenue\nLancas
 ter PA 17603
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 314836958/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260517T224421Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T224421Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Lancaster Freethought Society
UID:event_314988585@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260603T045607Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260621T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260621T120000
SUMMARY:LFS Coffee & Convo  
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nThe Coffee and Convo meetup is 
 always on the 3rd Sunday of the Month at 9am.\n\nWe will meet at Centervil
 le Diner\, 100 S. Centerville Rd.\n\nMeet up with fellow freethinkers to t
 alk\, eat or just have a warm or cold beverage of your choice. This is usu
 ally a small intimate meeting. It's about casual conversation and getting 
 to know your fellow freethinkers.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 314988585/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260528T015238Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260528T015238Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Lancaster Freethought Society
UID:event_314836994@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260603T045607Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260627T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260627T210000
SUMMARY:June Movie Night!  Arrakis Summer!
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nDune pt 3 (https://www.youtube.
 com/watch?v=3_9vCamtuPY) is scheduled to come to theaters this December\, 
 so I plan on showing:\n\nDune pt 1 and pt 2\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube
 .com/watch?v=8g18jFHCLXk\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Way9De
 xny3w\n\nOr\, as attendees wish\, we can show:\n\nDune (1984)\n-Trailer- h
 ttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hzUlXEyvJeA\n\nBattle of Algiers\n-Trailer-
  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vhhoS3zOskE\n\nGirls of the Sun\n-Trailer
 - https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sd5l-XAPdVc\n\nWhen the Moors Ruled in E
 urope\n-Trailer- https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f2x_VEO3PHA\n\nAnd many\,
  many more! Bring your own film selections and we may decide to show them!
 \n\nAdmission is Free! Bring as many family members and friends as you wou
 ld like! Please RSVP! Discussion after the movie(s)\, hang out and share y
 our thoughts!\n\nSome drinks and snacks will be provided\, please do bring
  more to share!\nPizza will be ordered\, please do chip in if you partake 
 in delivered food!\n\nSaturday\, June 27th\, 6:00pm - 10:00pm\nOther Room 
 Theater\n715 N. Pine St.\nLancaster PA 17603\n\nWe can delay starting the 
 movie to give people time to arrive\, but no later than 6:30pm\, please tr
 y to arrive before then if you do not want to miss any of the movie.\n\nPI
 CTURED below is the main entrance\, the event space is right up the stairs
 . On street parking should be available\, several public parking lots such
  as behind CVS are within a 2 blocks walk along Harrisburg Pike.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 314836994/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260517T224916Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T224916Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
